{{EnemiesAppearing|Teacher Cybear}}
'''Forged to Kill (Deadly)''' is the only stage in Cybear's Vengeance. Upon completion, it will always drop five [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]]. Like [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Facing Danger]], ''Cybear's Vengeance'' can only be beaten once per appearance, limiting Cat Ticket farming. This map usually appears during special occasions such as Christmas, New Year, or the game's anniversary. It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

You must clear [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 in order to have access to this stage.

